OL,3,ACar crashes into viral shop shutters
OL,4,Awhere gran was hoisted into the air
OL,5,
OL,6,FA shop made famous when a grandmother
OL,7,Fgot caught on its shutter and was left
OL,8,Fdangling in the air has hit the
OL,9,Fheadlines again after a car crashed
OL,10,Fthrough the front of it.
OL,12,FThe Best-One shop in Tonteg, Rhondda
OL,13,FCynon Taf, caught the dramatic moment
OL,14,Fon CCTV when a Jaguar smashed through
OL,15,Fits doors after mounting bollards and
OL,16,Fcrashing into the shop's coffee
OL,17,Fmachine.
OL,19,FIn March 2024, the shop went viral
OL,20,Fafter staff member Anne Hughes got
OL,21,Fcaught on the shutter while waiting for
OL,22,Fthe shop to open to start her shift.
OL,23,APub: 02-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
