OL,3,ACar crashes into viral shop shutters
OL,4,Awhere gran was hoisted into the air
OL,5,
OL,6,FAnne, who died in 2025, was left
OL,7,Fdangling 7ft (2.1 metres) in the air
OL,8,Fand shouting for the owner to help her,
OL,9,Fwith CCTV footage of the incident
OL,10,Fviewed tens of millions of times.
OL,23,APub: 02-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
